{"id":"n71457-10-12","stage":1,"title":"돌리다 · 转","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71457-10-12-1","ko":"자, 지금 그 자세에서 다리와 반대 방향으로 고개를 돌리세요.","zh":"好了，保持现在的姿势，把头转向与双腿相反的方向。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자,","meaning":"好吧","explanation":"자：好吧","readings":[{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25945","senseId":"2","lemma":"자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"자세에서","meaning":"姿势，姿态","explanation":"자세：姿势，姿态；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"자세","audio":"/audio/8cc096f62a2aeac2c96a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24780","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자세에서","audio":"/audio/b35d119122eb37d3d6a8.mp3"}},{"text":"다리와","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다리와","audio":"/audio/3d61674d48589e6abceb.mp3"}},{"text":"반대","meaning":"反，相反","explanation":"반대：反，相反","readings":[{"term":"반대","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69484","senseId":"1","lemma":"반대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반대","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3"}},{"text":"방향으로","meaning":"方向","explanation":"방향：方向；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"방향","audio":"/audio/d7895d7647666fe00cec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65533","senseId":"1","lemma":"방향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방향으로","audio":"/audio/42441f48ea68b4dda8f2.mp3"}},{"text":"고개를","meaning":"头，脑袋","explanation":"고개：头，脑袋；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고개","audio":"/audio/44adfe36e1f5e4fe0260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62501","senseId":"1","lemma":"고개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고개를","audio":"/audio/69819e4ad9039edb44e0.mp3"}},{"text":"돌리세요.","meaning":"转，掉转，扭转","explanation":"돌리다：转，掉转，扭转；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"10","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌리세요","audio":"/audio/e16602364f5cc7842fdf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"34f404d9d0a79aa5","term":"자","zh":"好吧","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3","entryId":"25945","definition":"用于引起别人的注意。","pronunciation":["자"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"8cc096f62a2aeac2","term":"자세","zh":"姿势，姿态","audio":"/audio/8cc096f62a2aeac2c96a.mp3","entryId":"24780","definition":"活动或支撑身体的态度。","pronunciation":["자세"]},{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"8b41caa49fef042d","term":"반대","zh":"反，相反","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3","entryId":"69484","defini