0.mp3"}},{"text":"되죠?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되죠","audio":"/audio/3ff4337d8fc3f95c4d8f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0d6426b428587e9d","term":"그니까","zh":"所以、也就是说","audio":"/audio/0d6426b428587e9d4eca.mp3","definition":"그러니까 的口语缩略，本句用于确认刚才的说明。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dc0103c11a2b107b","term":"왼쪽","zh":"左边","audio":"/audio/dc0103c11a2b107bbc7c.mp3","entryId":"30191","definition":"人面向北边时和西边相同的一侧。","pronunciation":["왼ː쪽","웬ː쪽"]},{"id":"44adfe36e1f5e4fe","term":"고개","zh":"头，脑袋","audio":"/audio/44adfe36e1f5e4fe0260.mp3","entryId":"62501","definition":"包括脖子在内的头部。","pronunciation":["고개"]},{"id":"6d22f9fa2b8915dd","term":"돌리다","zh":"转，掉转，扭转","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3","entryId":"71457","definition":"变换方向。","pronunciation":["돌리다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/884e184afc6036dcff82.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.595,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71457","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"10","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":2.0194,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["也就是说，把头转向左边就可以了，对吧？","好了，保持现在的姿势，把头转向与双腿相反的方向。","昨天家里进贼了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好了，保持现在的姿势，把头转向与双腿相反的方向。","昨天家里进贼了。","也就是说，把头转向左边就可以了，对吧？"],"answer":2}]}
